1
00:00:00,136 --> 00:00:01,262
Ia bukan nabi,

2
00:00:01,282 --> 00:00:02,546
bukan pula utusan.

3
00:00:02,566 --> 00:00:03,630
Hanya seorang lelaki yang

4
00:00:03,650 --> 00:00:05,241
bergegas dari ujung kota.

5
00:00:05,261 --> 00:00:06,201
Al-Qur'an mengabadikan

6
00:00:06,221 --> 00:00:07,580
kata-katanya.

7
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:09,877
Surah Yasin ayat tiga belas.

8
00:00:09,897 --> 00:00:11,254
Allah menjadikannya

9
00:00:11,274 --> 00:00:12,205
perumpamaan.

10
00:00:12,225 --> 00:00:13,815
Sebuah negeri didatangi dua

11
00:00:13,835 --> 00:00:14,767
orang utusan.

12
00:00:14,787 --> 00:00:15,757
Penduduknya mendustakan

13
00:00:15,777 --> 00:00:17,423
keduanya, lalu datang utusan

14
00:00:17,443 --> 00:00:18,052
ketiga.

15
00:00:18,072 --> 00:00:19,094
Mereka tetap menolak.

16
00:00:19,114 --> 00:00:20,557
Kata penduduk:

17
00:00:20,577 --> 00:00:22,183
kalian hanyalah manusia

18
00:00:22,203 --> 00:00:23,185
seperti kami.

19
00:00:23,205 --> 00:00:25,075
Kami malah sial karena kalian.

20
00:00:25,095 --> 00:00:26,406
Jika tidak berhenti,

21
00:00:26,426 --> 00:00:28,090
kami rajam kalian.

22
00:00:28,110 --> 00:00:29,653
Lalu datanglah dari ujung kota

23
00:00:29,673 --> 00:00:31,043
seorang laki-laki,

24
00:00:31,063 --> 00:00:32,127
bergegas.

25
00:00:32,147 --> 00:00:33,177
Ia berkata:

26
00:00:33,197 --> 00:00:34,336
wahai kaumku,

27
00:00:34,356 --> 00:00:35,985
ikutilah utusan-utusan itu.

28
00:00:36,005 --> 00:00:37,192
Ikutilah orang yang tidak

29
00:00:37,212 --> 00:00:38,629
meminta imbalan darimu.

30
00:00:38,649 --> 00:00:39,686
Ia berkata:

31
00:00:39,706 --> 00:00:40,940
mengapa aku tidak menyembah

32
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:42,579
Dia yang telah menciptakanku?

33
00:00:42,599 --> 00:00:44,142
Mengapa aku menyembah tuhan

34
00:00:44,162 --> 00:00:45,628
lain, yang tak bisa menolongku

35
00:00:45,648 --> 00:00:46,416
sedikit pun?

36
00:00:46,436 --> 00:00:48,182
Sungguh, aku telah beriman

37
00:00:48,202 --> 00:00:49,240
kepada Tuhanmu,

38
00:00:49,260 --> 00:00:50,735
maka dengarkanlah aku.

39
00:00:50,755 --> 00:00:51,989
Menurut riwayat dalam Tafsir

40
00:00:52,009 --> 00:00:53,009
Ibnu Katsir,

41
00:00:53,029 --> 00:00:54,325
kaumnya membunuhnya saat itu

42
00:00:54,345 --> 00:00:54,925
juga.

43
00:00:54,945 --> 00:00:56,347
Qatadah meriwayatkan,

44
00:00:56,367 --> 00:00:57,911
saat disakiti ia masih berdoa:

45
00:00:57,931 --> 00:00:59,103
ya Allah,

46
00:00:59,123 --> 00:01:00,031
berilah petunjuk kepada

47
00:01:00,051 --> 00:01:01,629
kaumku, karena mereka tidak

48
00:01:01,649 --> 00:01:02,381
mengetahui.

49
00:01:02,401 --> 00:01:03,309
Al-Qur'an tidak merinci

50
00:01:03,329 --> 00:01:04,006
kematiannya.

51
00:01:04,026 --> 00:01:04,842
Ayat berikutnya langsung

52
00:01:04,862 --> 00:01:05,291
berkata:

53
00:01:05,311 --> 00:01:06,627
masuklah ke surga.

54
00:01:06,647 --> 00:01:09,537
Dan kalimat pertamanya di sana

55
00:01:09,557 --> 00:01:11,429
bukan tentang dirinya:

56
00:01:11,449 --> 00:01:12,652
alangkah baiknya sekiranya

57
00:01:12,672 --> 00:01:14,655
kaumku mengetahui,

58
00:01:14,675 --> 00:01:16,349
apa yang membuat Tuhanku

59
00:01:16,369 --> 00:01:17,150
mengampuniku.

60
00:01:17,170 --> 00:01:19,063
Bahkan setelah disakiti,

61
00:01:19,083 --> 00:01:20,193
yang ia pikirkan tetap

62
00:01:20,213 --> 00:01:20,945
kaumnya.

63
00:01:20,965 --> 00:01:22,091
Siapa yang paling ingin kamu

64
00:01:22,111 --> 00:01:23,332
ajak pada kebaikan?

65
00:01:23,352 --> 00:01:24,691
Kisah dalam Al-Qur'an,

66
00:01:24,711 --> 00:01:25,823
bersama AUDIRA.

